cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and this archived code."
title: "geodesic-anomaly-test: Information-geometric hypothesis testing on the categorical statistical manifold"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, simulations, analytic finite-sample checks, and the
  real-data (NSL-KDD) experiment for information-geometric hypothesis testing on
  the categorical statistical manifold. Includes the exact relation to the
  Freeman-Tukey/Hellinger statistic and the revised non-correctability calculation.
type: software
